Important External Services / Data Sources

These are not npm dependencies, but the repository documentation
indicates that the application relies on or integrates with them:

OpenStreetMap - Supplies map tiles for the web map.

Nominatim - Used as a geocoding data source.

Apple Maps - Native map provider on iOS through react-native-maps.

Official venue / city / Cal Poly / Visit SLO sources - Used as sources
for activity/catalog data.

Common Project Commands

Install dependencies: npm install

Start Expo: npm start

Start web version: npm run web

Start Android: npm run android

Start iOS: npm run ios

Run TypeScript type checking: npm run typecheck

Run tests: npm test

Export web build: npm run export:web

Export native iOS + Android builds: npm run export:native

